(
F5 W1 U6: mrange above the compiled GNU limit MRANGE (500000, tochnog.h):
 the GNU range buffers have a fixed compiled size, so a larger mrange is
 an error naming the constant to raise (the Professional 02-08-2026
 accepts mrange 100000000; DIVERGENCES MRANGE-COMPILED).
  EXPECTED_ERROR: increase MRANGE in tochnog.h and recompile )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
